          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Tie an eraser (or a potato) to one end of a thread."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.426,
            0.743,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Hang the eraser by holding the other end of the thread (Fig. 5.16). Keep your hand steady."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.474,
            0.743,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Using the other hand, take the eraser slightly to one side and then release (Fig. 5.16)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.52,
            0.743,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Does it start moving to and fro? Is its motion similar to the motion of a swing?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.566,
            0.744,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When an object moves to and fro about some fixed position, its motion is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "oscillatory motion.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
